Original commit body from 144077f:

- Use streaming json.dump() instead of json.dumps() + write_text()
- Free Symbol/Edge objects after tier/compact processing (they're
  converted to dicts in behavior_map and no longer needed)
- Add incremental cleanup for RankedSymbol, UsageContext, Entrypoint,
  LinkerContext, and captured_symbols after their data is extracted
- Add gc.collect() between tier generations and before final write
- Add optional memory telemetry (HG_MEMORY_DEBUG env var) for debugging

Testing on tensorflow (154k symbols, 505k edges):
- Before: ~11 GB peak memory (caused terminal unresponsiveness)
- After: ~2.1 GB peak memory (80% reduction)
